    <div class="about" id="about" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="About us" hidden>
      <div class="about__page" data-lenis-prevent>
        <div class="about__row">
          <p class="about__label t12s" data-line>About Us:</p>
          <div class="about__text">
            <p data-lines>At OTTO, our fascination with design has never been limited to a single discipline.</p>
            <p data-lines>With roots in graphic design, we've always been drawn to the relationship between form, composition, proportion, and material. Over time, that curiosity naturally extended beyond the screen and into the physical world.</p>
            <p data-lines>Inspired by modernism and the beauty of everyday objects, we explore how simple forms, thoughtful proportions, and unexpected material combinations can give familiar things a new character.</p>
            <p data-lines>For us, OTTO is another way to express what we've always loved about design. Only this time, it's something you can touch, use, and live with.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="about__slogan t12" data-line>A love for design, in every form.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about__row about__row--objects">
