            <li class="is-soon" data-line>Chair U (Coming Soon)</li>
            <li class="is-soon" data-line>Table U (Coming Soon)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="about__copy t12" data-line>©2026. OTTO Objects.</p>
